New gTLD Applications Dataset License
=====================================

ICANN columns
-------------

The columns string, u_label, applicant, applicant_country, application_id, type, status, contention_set, announced_on are ICANN's (the Internet Corporation for Assigned Names and Numbers), some normalized as DATA_DICTIONARY.md describes. ICANN's terms of use apply to them, and Unique.domains claims no rights in them.

Unique.domains columns
----------------------

The columns in_word_corpus, word_popularity_band, comparable_sales_band are Unique.domains data. Copyright (c) Unique.domains.

